OL,3,GNEWSAPlan to buy Doncaster Sheffield
OL,4,AAirport approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to bring Doncaster Sheffield
OL,7,FAirport (DSA) under public ownership
OL,8,Fhave been approved, marking a major
OL,9,Fstep to it reopening.
OL,11,FOn Tuesday, South Yorkshire Mayoral
OL,12,FCombined Authority (SYMCA) agreed to
OL,13,Fbuy the airport and adjacent Innovation
OL,14,FQuarter employment land from current
OL,15,Flandowner Peel.
OL,17,FThe decision means SYMCA will become
OL,18,Fthe freehold owner and landlord to the
OL,19,FCity of Doncaster Council lease.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
