OL,3,GNEWSAPlan to buy Doncaster Sheffield
OL,4,AAirport approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FMayor Oliver Coppard said he wanted to
OL,7,Fthank everyone involved for their
OL,8,Fefforts, especially the public whose
OL,9,Fsupport had been "incredibly effective"
OL,10,Fin bringing the airport back into
OL,11,Fpublic ownership.
